- ``scripts/validate_migration_naming.py`` does not see it.
- It cannot dual-head against WI-1 while PR #1687 owns
  ``alembic/versions/20261030_lib_wi1_cel_harden_scheme.py``.

When WI-1 is LIVE on ``main``, copy this sketch into
``alembic/versions/20261031_lib_wi2_file_homes_documents_id.py`` (or next free
date prefix), keep ``down_revision = "20261030_lib_wi1_cel"``, land ORM columns
in the same PR, and open the implementing PR.

Revision ID (planned): 20261031_lib_wi2_homes
Revises (planned):     20261030_lib_wi1_cel
Create Date:           2026-08-09

Planned DDL
-----------
1. ``carbon_evidence.document_id`` INTEGER NULL
   FK → ``documents.id`` ON DELETE SET NULL
   Index ``ix_carbon_evidence_document_id``
2. ``evidence_assets.document_id`` INTEGER NULL
   FK → ``documents.id`` ON DELETE SET NULL
   Index ``ix_evidence_assets_document_id``
3. UVDB ``documents_presented`` — **no new column** in this draft; data migrate
   rewrites JSON elements to ``{"document_id": int|null, "label": str|null}``
   via steward / prep scripts (see ``file_homes_migrate_prep.py``).

